{
 "note": "byte-identical copies of the jcp-robust r2acc / select2d import closure (verified against the git blob at the imp-fronts HEAD, which carries jcp-robust via the jcp-consolidated fork point). Never edit these files; imp-fronts additions live in separate files (policy_sm.py, bankguard.py, fcases.py, fpolicy.py, mkconfigs_sel.py, register_arm.py). Path note: p1core/qcore/npcheck derive ROOT from their own depth, which is one level too shallow here; the modules engines / iterative_paths (mr-burgers2d) and sep_common (separable-decoder) are therefore put on PYTHONPATH by env.sh (r2acc, select2d) or by fpolicy.py itself. The incumbent default checkpoint path (T2.CKPT, NC.CKPT) does not resolve from this copy: every run here names its bank explicitly (K0 is not ROM-scored, DESIGN Amendment 1 B8).",
